<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct aluminium output, shipments rise - body.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct aluminium output, shipments rise - body.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese output and shipments of fabricated aluminium products in October rose by 7.5 percent and 8.6 percent, respectively, against a year earlier, the Japan Aluminum Federation said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The October data were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Oct 96	 yr/yr change     Sept 96 (revised)</p>
<p> Output	   218,989	  + 7.5 pct	   216,418</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  105,864	  + 4.6 pct	   106,514</p>
<p>   Extrusions   113,125	  +10.4 pct	   109,904</p>
<p> Shipments	219,042	  + 8.6 pct	   209,565</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  104,843	  + 5.7 pct	    99,904</p>
<p>   Extrusions   114,199	  +11.5 pct	   109,661</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk 81-3-3432-7391 --</p>
</text>
